    interface actually answers.  TLS verification is off by default because device
    certificates are self-signed (`CN = AlliedwarePlusDefault`).
    It was corrected once during the case: an AW+ device answers plain http with a 301 to
    https, and a context attached only to an https:// starting URL is not in play by the time
