    Last login: Mon Oct 19 22:58:11 UTC 2026 on ttyS0
    No entry for terminal type "network";
    using vt100 terminal settings.
    AlliedWare Plus (TM) 0.0.0 10/12/26 06:38:00

    awplus>
    LOGIN RESULT: USER  proto=telnet  user=manager  seconds=0.2

